     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hello all!</div><div><br></div><div>We will be having a working group tomorrow from 10am-12pm in the DataLab classroom (360 Shields Library). During the first hour, I will give a tutorial on using the dplyr commands group_by, summarize, arrange, and count. I hope to see you there!</div><div><br></div><div>The presentation schedule for the rest of the quarter is included below.</div><div><table dir=\"ltr\" style=\"table-layout:fixed;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;width:0px;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col width=\"100\"><col width=\"472\"></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">01/23/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">Intro to rasters</td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">01/30/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(17,85,204);border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\"><a href=\"https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/03-dplyr.html#reshaping_with_gather_and_spread\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datacarpentry.org/R-ecology-lesson/03-dplyr.html%23reshaping_with_gather_and_spread&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465537535000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Lsf0Op9_Xs8cssZa0cyG7\">tidyr converting between wide and long</a></td></tr><tr style=\"height:21px\"><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-align:right;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\">02/06/20</td><td style=\"overflow:hidden;padding:2px 3px;vertical-align:bottom;text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(17,85,204);border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204)\"><a hr